---
// Privacy Policy Page for TAR
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import FooterSection from "../components/FooterSection.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — TAR" 
  description="TAR Privacy Policy: Local-first data architecture, zero user data selling, zero model training on private messages, and full data sovereignty."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="legal-main">
    <div class="container legal-container font-dm-sans">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <div class="legal-badge">Legal Policy</div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-lead">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </header>

      <hr class="legal-divider" />

      <article class="legal-body">
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Fundamental Principles</h2>
          <p>
            At TAR, we believe that your business data, patient conversations, customer contacts, and operational records belong exclusively to you. Our architecture is designed around a local-first philosophy where data resides primarily on your hardware.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Data We Do and Do Not Collect</h2>
          <p><strong>What stays on your device:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your local store database, sales ledgers, customer lists, inventory, and order records.</li>
            <li>Your local business documents and product catalogs.</li>
            <li>Direct local chat transcripts and customer interaction logs.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>What is processed for service delivery:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>AI Operations:</strong> When you invoke AI actions (e.g. WhatsApp auto-reply, audio note transcription, or OCR scan), the specific prompt text or media is sent transiently to provider APIs (Groq Whisper, Gemma, DeepSeek) to fulfill the operation.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero Model Training:</strong> Your inputs and customer messages are <strong>never</strong> used to train or fine-tune public or third-party AI models.</li>
            <li><strong>Encrypted Cloud Sync (Optional):</strong> If you enable multi-device sync, encrypted data transactions are replicated via TLS 1.3 over secure cloud servers.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Zero Data Monetization or Selling</h2>
          <p>
            We do not sell, rent, monetize, or broker personal data, patient communications, or business telemetry to any third party, data broker, or advertiser.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. Data Portability and Erasure</h2>
          <p>
            Because TAR uses standard open data formats, you can export your entire workspace at any moment with a single tap. If you delete your workspace, local records are immediately erased from your device and any synced cloud backups are purged.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding our privacy practices or data handling, contact us directly at <a href="mailto:privacy@tarfw.com" class="legal-link">privacy@tarfw.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <FooterSection />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-main {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-ink-black);
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding: 56px 0 88px 0;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .legal-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-canopy-green);
    background-color: #ecfdf5;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.6vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-canopy-green);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-lead {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    margin: 28px 0 36px 0;
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .legal-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-canopy-green);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-graphite);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 4px 0 0 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-graphite);
  }

  .legal-link {
    color: var(--color-canopy-green);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
